Interactability_Text_Line_2 State-Wide Emergency Declared in Rio
Interactability_Text_Line_3 The State of Rio de Janeiro has declared state of public emergency after yet another coastal town was overrun by turned hordes yesterday, marking the sixth city to be overrun this week since turned crossed the border with Espírito Santo.